"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":67.95,"default_fair_val":67.95,"premium_pct":-33,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":14.8,"pe_forward":13,"pb_trailing":5,"pb_forward":4.5,"div_yield":1.74,"ps_ratio":2.3,"fcf_to_ev":6.15,"fcf_to_mcap":10.91,"liab_to_assets":105.9,"cash_to_assets":14.5,"current_ratio":1.72,"roe":18,"roa":17.5,"moat":{"ticker":"MTCH","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Match Group 旗下擁有 Tinder、Hinge 等多個知名品牌，在線上交友市場建立了強大的品牌識別度與用戶忠誠度。雖然用戶可以免費使用基本功能，但其高級訂閱服務和虛擬商品提供了穩定的營收來源，顯示出一定的定價能力。然而，市場競爭激烈，用戶對品牌忠誠度並非絕對，且新興平台的出現可能挑戰其品牌優勢，因此定價權壁壘為堅固等級。","comment_en":"Match Group boasts a portfolio of strong brands like Tinder and Hinge, establishing significant brand recognition and user loyalty in the online dating market. While basic features are free, premium subscriptions and virtual goods generate substantial revenue, indicating some pricing power. However, the market is highly competitive, user loyalty isn't absolute, and emerging platforms pose a challenge, placing this moat at a solid level."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"線上交友行業的進入門檻相對較低，主要依賴技術創新和用戶體驗，而非專利或嚴格的監管壁壘。Match Group 的核心競爭力在於其平台運營和用戶網絡，而非受專利保護的獨特技術。監管風險主要來自數據隱私和內容審核，而非保護其市場地位的特許權。因此，此維度壁壘極弱。","comment_en":"The online dating industry has relatively low barriers to entry, relying more on technological innovation and user experience than patents or strict regulatory moats. Match Group's competitive edge lies in platform operations and user networks, not patented technology. Regulatory risks primarily concern data privacy and content moderation, not exclusive rights protecting its market position. Thus, this moat is very weak."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"用戶在線上交友平台上的轉換成本相對較低，因為建立個人資料、習慣使用介面和社交網絡的轉移相對容易。然而，用戶在特定平台上建立的社交關係和聲譽（例如在 Hinge 上累積的匹配記錄）會產生一定的黏性。Match Group 透過其龐大的用戶基礎和多樣化的產品組合，試圖透過提供不同體驗來增加用戶的留存，但轉換成本仍屬中等。","comment_en":"Switching costs for users in online dating platforms are generally moderate. While creating profiles and transferring social connections is relatively easy, users build history and reputation on specific platforms (e.g., match history on Hinge), creating some stickiness. Match Group leverages its vast user base and diverse offerings to increase retention by providing varied experiences. However, the overall switching cost remains moderate."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"網絡效應是 Match Group 最強大的護城河之一。Tinder 等平台的價值隨著用戶數量的增加而顯著提升，更多的用戶吸引更多的用戶，形成正向循環。用戶越多，匹配成功的機率越高，這使得新進入者難以與現有龐大網絡競爭。這種強烈的網絡效應是其核心競爭優勢，屬於罕見壁壘等級。","comment_en":"Network effects are one of Match Group's strongest moats. The value of platforms like Tinder increases significantly with more users, creating a virtuous cycle where more users attract even more users. A larger user base enhances the probability of successful matches, making it difficult for new entrants to compete with the established network. This powerful network effect is a core competitive advantage, representing a rare barrier."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Match Group 透過其龐大的用戶基礎和全球營運規模，在獲客成本和營運效率上享有顯著的規模經濟優勢。其多元化的產品組合能夠分攤研發和行銷成本，並能更有效地利用數據分析來優化用戶體驗和廣告投放。這種規模優勢使其能夠以更低的單位成本提供服務，並在市場上保持競爭力，屬於堅固等級。","comment_en":"Match Group benefits from significant economies of scale in customer acquisition and operational efficiency due to its massive user base and global operations. Its diverse product portfolio allows for the distribution of R&D and marketing costs and more effective use of data analytics to optimize user experience and ad targeting. This scale provides a cost advantage, enabling competitive service delivery and maintaining market position, classifying it as solid."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"線上交友市場的本質是數位化和全球化，較少受到獨特地理位置或實體資產的限制。Match Group 的優勢在於其品牌組合和用戶網絡，而非特定地理區域的獨有資源。雖然其在不同國家和地區的市場滲透率有所差異，但這些並非不可複製的地理資產，因此此維度壁壘極弱。","comment_en":"The online dating market is inherently digital and global, with limited reliance on unique geographical locations or physical assets. Match Group's strength lies in its brand portfolio and user network, not exclusive resources in specific regions. While market penetration varies by country, these are not irreplicable geographical assets, making this moat very weak."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Match Group 在營運效率方面表現出色，透過數據分析持續優化平台功能、用戶匹配算法和廣告系統，以提升用戶參與度和貨幣化效率。其龐大的用戶基礎和成熟的技術架構支持了高效的營運。儘管持續的創新和市場變化帶來挑戰，但其卓越的營運能力是其堅實的競爭優勢之一，屬於堅固等級。","comment_en":"Match Group demonstrates strong operational efficiency, leveraging data analytics to continuously optimize platform features, matching algorithms, and advertising systems, thereby enhancing user engagement and monetization. Its vast user base and mature technological infrastructure support efficient operations. Despite challenges from ongoing innovation and market shifts, its excellent operational capabilities are a solid competitive advantage, placing it in the solid category."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Match Group 的資本配置策略顯示出其專注於核心業務的增長和戰略性收購。公司透過回購股票和審慎的併購活動來提升股東價值。雖然過去曾有較大的收購（如 Tinder），但整體而言，其資本配置決策相對理性，能夠支持業務的持續擴張和盈利能力的提升。此維度屬於堅固等級。","comment_en":"Match Group's capital allocation strategy reflects a focus on core business growth and strategic acquisitions. The company enhances shareholder value through share buybacks and prudent M&A activities. While significant acquisitions like Tinder have occurred, overall capital allocation decisions appear rational, supporting sustained business expansion and profitability. This dimension is considered solid."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Match Group 透過持續優化用戶體驗、引入新功能和利用網絡效應來維持用戶活躍度和忠誠度。其多品牌策略能夠滿足不同用戶群體的需求，從而提高整體用戶留存率。雖然用戶流動性是線上交友平台的固有挑戰，但透過不斷的產品迭代和社群經營，Match Group 成功地維持了較高的用戶黏性，屬於堅固等級。","comment_en":"Match Group maintains user activity and loyalty by continuously optimizing user experience, introducing new features, and leveraging network effects. Its multi-brand strategy caters to diverse user needs, thereby improving overall retention. While user churn is inherent in online dating, consistent product iteration and community engagement enable Match Group to sustain relatively high user stickiness, classifying this moat as solid."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"線上交友市場的長期穩定性面臨挑戰，技術變革和用戶偏好轉變可能隨時影響市場格局。然而，Match Group 旗下擁有 Tinder 和 Hinge 等領導品牌，且其網絡效應和規模經濟提供了相當的防禦力。只要能持續適應市場變化並保持創新，其商業模式具有一定的長期韌性，但非絕對的持久性，故屬於中等。","comment_en":"The long-term stability of the online dating market faces challenges, with technological shifts and evolving user preferences potentially altering the landscape. However, Match Group's ownership of leading brands like Tinder and Hinge, coupled with its network effects and economies of scale, provides considerable defense. As long as it continues to adapt and innovate, its business model exhibits a degree of long-term resilience, though not absolute permanence, placing it in the moderate category."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Match Group 的核心護城河來自於其強大的網絡效應（M4），這使得其平台（尤其是 Tinder）對用戶極具吸引力，並形成難以逾越的進入壁壘。此外，其品牌實力（M1）、規模經濟帶來的成本優勢（M5）、卓越的營運效率（M7）以及相對穩定的用戶留存（M9）共同構成了堅實的競爭防禦。然而，其專利與監管壁壘（M2）和地理資產（M6）相對薄弱，轉換成本（M3）和商業模式的長期持久性（M10）也存在一定的不確定性。整體而言，Match Group 擁有一個以網絡效應為核心的、類似於「收費橋」的商業模式，能夠從龐大的用戶流量中獲取價值，但需警惕市場變化和新興競爭者的挑戰。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Match Group's primary moat lies in its powerful network effects (M4), making its platforms, especially Tinder, highly attractive and creating significant barriers to entry. This is complemented by strong brand recognition (M1), cost advantages from economies of scale (M5), excellent operational efficiency (M7), and solid customer retention (M9). However, its moats in patents/regulation (M2) and unique geographical assets (M6) are weak. Switching costs (M3) and long-term durability (M10) also present uncertainties. Overall, Match Group operates a 'toll bridge'-like business model, centered on network effects, monetizing vast user traffic. It faces challenges from market evolution and emerging competitors.","evidenceHash":"de6ca35ec410f6462cba278b1134fa45da62985139cf5d44d2e2a3a19cf975a4","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"dc9bfbeae85ff89347389cacefd2bd906639d877d865091fe8dbff054e2fac5f"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"dc9bfbeae85ff89347389cacefd2bd906639d877d865091fe8dbff054e2fac5f"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/MTCH.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/MTCH.png","website":"https://mtch.com","ceo":"Spencer Rascoff","full_time_employees":"2205","description":"Match Group, Inc. provides digital technologies in the United States and internationally. It operates through four segments: Tinder, Hinge, Evergreen and Emerging, and Match Group Asia. The company's portfolio of brands includes Tinder, Hinge, Match, Meetic, OkCupid, Pairs, Plenty Of Fish, Azar, BLK, and other brands, built to increase users' likelihood of connecting with others. It provides tailored services to meet the various preferences of its users. Match Group, Inc. was incorporated in 1986 and is based in Dallas, Texas.","description_en":"Match Group, Inc. provides digital technologies in the United States and internationally. It operates through four segments: Tinder, Hinge, Evergreen and Emerging, and Match Group Asia. The company's portfolio of brands includes Tinder, Hinge, Match, Meetic, OkCupid, Pairs, Plenty Of Fish, Azar, BLK, and other brands, built to increase users' likelihood of connecting with others. It provides tailored services to meet the various preferences of its users. Match Group, Inc. was incorporated in 1986 and is based in Dallas, Texas.","description_zh":"**Match Group, Inc. (MTCH) 業務營運分析**\n\nMatch Group, Inc. 是一家領先的數位科技公司，專注於提供多元化的線上交友平台，業務遍及美國及全球。公司營運劃分為四大主要板塊：Tinder、Hinge、Evergreen and Emerging，以及 Match Group Asia。\n\n其品牌組合涵蓋了業界知名的交友應用程式，包括 Tinder、Hinge、Match、Meetic、OkCupid、Pairs、Plenty Of Fish、Azar、BLK 等。這些平台的核心目標是透過創新的數位技術，提升使用者與潛在對象建立連結的機率。Match Group 透過提供高度個人化且客製化的服務，以滿足不同使用者在交友偏好上的多樣化需求。公司透過其龐大的品牌生態系與先進的配對演算法，持續鞏固其在全球線上交友市場的領導地位。","address":"8750 North Central Expressway","city":"Dallas","state":"TX","zip":"75231","country":"US","phone":"214 576 9352","full_address":"8750 North Central Expressway, Dallas, TX 75231, US","range_52w":"28.81-46.67","year_high":46.67,"year_low":28.81,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":28.81,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"Schiffman Glenn","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":374,"price":40.15,"total_val":0.02},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"Jones Laura Rachel","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":342,"price":40.15,"total_val":0.01},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"Edgett Sean","title":"officer: Chief Leg. & Corp. Aff. Off.","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":945,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"Edgett Sean","title":"officer: Chief Leg. & Corp. Aff. Off.","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":22806,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"Edgett Sean","title":"officer: Chief Leg. & Corp. Aff. Off.","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":12085,"price":40.15,"total_val":0.49},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"Edgett Sean","title":"officer: Chief Leg. & Corp. Aff. Off.","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":22806,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"Edgett Sean","title":"officer: Chief Leg. & Corp. Aff. Off.","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":945,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"CAVE